    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d976">

                <pb facs="0945" n="847" sameAs="frus:frus1900/pg847"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr.
                            Thieriot.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1900-08-10"><hi rendition="#italic">August 10,
                        1900</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 19.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have to acknowledge the receipt of your
                    No. 44 of the 24th ultimo inclosing the translation of a note from the minister
                    of foreign affairs advising you of the deposit in London of the money awarded by
                    the Delagoa Bay arbitration.</p>
                <p>The like information was communicated to the Department by the chargé d’affaires
                    ad interim of Portugal at Washington in a note dated the 21st ultimo.</p>
                <p>I inclose for your information a copy of the Department’s note<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d976-f1"/> of July 27 by which the chargé was informed that the
                    Government of the United States is not to be understood as authorizing or
                    acquiescing in the making of said deposit, and in ackowledging the same it does
                    so without prejudice and with reservation of all its rights, of whatever nature
                    they may be, in the premises.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Alvey A. Adee</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Acting Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
